{"id":944,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><style></style><div><p><br></p><p>为强化部门工作人员办公软件实操能力，紧跟数字化办公趋势，2025年11月14日，机械工程学院就业委员会组织开展办公技能专项培训，部门全体成员参与学习。本次培训由王淋学长主讲，涵盖Excel、Word实操及AI办公软件应用两大核心内容。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QnlCqZo7-PUNUsLpl-sMm7iLznRMlWvfMm9aozARUmAVUl-0gihFp2hmCIa0USyDUYh2UYhVo7n7L8rfMz74UN7aoR-sn7-8U4viU4vZnlMFL8W7Um6knmMFLznknmvJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz9PM1yYoz98MYbw6268c&oid=1069369254&tid=1816&nid=29847&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A6CFCE8DD3EA513BA0827DB4C75C78EC/3BDB7BF3/14BF7\" vheight=\"315.8699951171875\" vwidth=\"421.3299865722656\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QnlCqZo7-PUNUsLpl-sMm7iLznRMlWvfMm9aozARUmAVUl-0gihFp2hmCIa0USyDUYh2UYhVo7n7L8rfMz74UN7aoR-sn7-8U4viU4vZnlMFL8W7Um6knmMFLznknmvJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz9PM1yYoz98MYbw6268c&oid=1069369254&tid=1816&nid=29847&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>培训中，王淋学长围绕工作实际需求，以Excel为重点，从数据处理、结构美化、数据打印三大模块展开细致讲解。他结合就业统计、表格制作等常见工作场景，通过现场演示、实例表格展示等方式，直观传授数据录入规范、公式运用、格式优化、打印参数设置等实用技巧，让复杂操作变得通俗易懂。此外，学长还针对AI办公软件的使用方法、核心优势及适用局限进行简要介绍，为大家拓展数字化办公思路。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QLRWq7nNlsLNCaLp49aM7QfoRWkLzAvRM4VVnmV7L8rkUmG0gihFp2hmCIa0okh2UYhfokyYoz9ioRrRUln7UlLZn7-DLRGZMm67nR9YoznFnzviUlQ2ozrFLzUYM8-JqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz9PM1yYoz98MYbw6268c&oid=1069369254&tid=1816&nid=29847&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8FCA8298585CADDAC8DB600867DD8294/E75AFF95/1427B\" vheight=\"275.92999267578125\" vwidth=\"472.6700134277344\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QLRWq7nNlsLNCaLp49aM7QfoRWkLzAvRM4VVnmV7L8rkUmG0gihFp2hmCIa0okh2UYhfokyYoz9ioRrRUln7UlLZn7-DLRGZMm67nR9YoznFnzviUlQ2ozrFLzUYM8-JqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz9PM1yYoz98MYbw6268c&oid=1069369254&tid=1816&nid=29847&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此次培训内容兼具实用性与前瞻性，既填补了成员办公技能短板，又普及了AI工具应用知识，有效提升了工作效率与数字化素养。参训成员表示，将把所学技能灵活运用到日常工作中，为学院就业服务工作的规范化、高效化开展提供有力支撑。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 一审一校：焦路霏<br></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 二审二校：冯煜</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 三审三校：李红丹</p></div></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QnlCqZo7-PUNUsLpl-sMm7iLznRMlWvfMm9aozARUmAVUl-0gihFp2hmCIa0USyDUYh2UYhVo7n7L8rfMz74UN7aoR-sn7-8U4viU4vZnlMFL8W7Um6knmMFLznknmvJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz9PM1yYoz98MYbw6268c&oid=1069369254&tid=1816&nid=29847&e=.jpeg"}